        {
          "title": "固态硬盘外接盒",
          "content": "<p>一家德国公司推出了 M.2 接口的固态硬盘外接盒，样子就像真空管一样，非常新奇。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202308/bg2023082109.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202308/bg2023082110.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
